{"name":"The Assign Lamp","slug":"glyph-assign-lamp","blurb":"On the bind street, Faye carries the lamp toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Assign. Click the lamp and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Assign Lamp.","seal":"7f6b0244242630a9584e0d0de1410469cc9cb8957a4d22ef2f16a8fdfefb4049"}
